# Backend origin. Do NOT include /api - API functions add their own /api prefix.
# Point this at your Laravel server, e.g. http://127.0.0.1:8000
VITE_API_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8000

# Walk the app without a backend: `pnpm dev:mock` instead of `pnpm dev`.
#
# It serves a stand-in API from the dev server on the same origin, answering the
# seven endpoints the app calls and using the lesson fixtures in
# src/features/lessons/fixtures, so every block type is walkable. Sign in with any
# username. Nothing here changes, so `pnpm dev` still talks to a real API.
# See mock-api/plugin.ts.